# 1. ADMIN API

## 1.1 Admin Signup
POST http://localhost:8181/admin/register-admin
content-type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "",
  "lastname": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}
###

## 1.2 Admin Login
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:8181/admin/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "rememberMe": false
}
###

## 1.3 Admin Profile
GET http://localhost:8181/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}
###

## 1.3.1 Admin Reset Password
POST http://localhost:8181/admin/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "password": "",
  "resetPasswordToken": ""
}
###

## 1.4 Admin Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:8181/admin/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}
###


# 2. USER API

## 2.1 User Signup
POST http://localhost:8181/api/auth/local/register
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}
###

## 2.2 User Login
# @name userLogin
POST http://localhost:8181/api/auth/local
content-type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "",
  "password": ""
}
###

## 2.3 User Profile
GET http://localhost:8181/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}
###

## 2.3.1 User Reset Password
POST http://localhost:8181/api/auth/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "code": "",
  "password": "",
  "passwordConfirmation": ""
}
###

## 2.4 User Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:8181/api/auth/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}
###